   "a": "C",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Kapalı silindir: r = 3 cm</li> <li>Açınımda yanal yüz kare; π = 3</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Kutunun yüzey alanı (cm²)</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Yükseklik</b> Yanal yüz kare olduğu için yükseklik taban çevresine eşittir. <span class=\"sv-m\">h = 2 · 3 · 3 = 18 cm</span></li> <li><b>Yanal alan</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">18 · 18 = 324 cm²</span></li> <li><b>İki taban</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">2 · 3 · 3² = 54 cm²</span></li> <li><b>Toplam</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">324 + 54 = 378 cm²</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 312 304\" width=\"312\" role=\"img\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"68\" width=\"162\" height=\"162\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"88.6\" cy=\"41\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"153.4\" cy=\"257\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"88.6\" y1=\"41\" x2=\"115.6\" y2=\"41\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"121.6\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"start\">r = 3</text><text x=\"121\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">18 × 18 kare</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"start\">h = 18</text></svg><figcaption>Yanal yüz karedir: kenarları hem çevre hem yükseklik (18 cm).</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Yalnız yanal yüzü almak (→ 324) ya da tek taban eklemek (→ 351).</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
