   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Bir hediyelik eşya dükkânında, ayrıtı 5 cm olan küp biçimindeki 4 özdeş kutu birlikte paketlenecektir. Kutular, yüzleri tam çakışacak biçimde bir araya getirilerek bir <b>dikdörtgenler prizması</b> oluşturulacak ve bu prizmanın tüm dış yüzeyi ambalaj kâğıdıyla kaplanacaktır.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 215\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ayrıtı 5 cm olan 4 özdeş küp kutu\"><polygon points=\"24,110 44,95 90,95 70,110\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"#0369a1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"70,110 90,95 90,141 70,156\" fill=\"#7dd3fc\" stroke=\"#0369a1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"24\" y=\"110\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" fill=\"#bae6fd\" stroke=\"#0369a1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"102,110 122,95 168,95 148,110\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"#0369a1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"148,110 168,95 168,141 148,156\" fill=\"#7dd3fc\" stroke=\"#0369a1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"102\" y=\"110\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" fill=\"#bae6fd\" stroke=\"#0369a1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"180,110 200,95 246,95 226,110\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"#0369a1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"226,110 246,95 246,141 226,156\" fill=\"#7dd3fc\" stroke=\"#0369a1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"110\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" fill=\"#bae6fd\" stroke=\"#0369a1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"258,110 278,95 324,95 304,110\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"#0369a1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"304,110 324,95 324,141 304,156\" fill=\"#7dd3fc\" stroke=\"#0369a1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"258\" y=\"110\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" fill=\"#bae6fd\" stroke=\"#0369a1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"47\" y=\"175\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">5 cm</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\">4 özdeş küp kutu</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"80\" width=\"190\" height=\"80\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\"/><text x=\"455\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Kutular yüzleri tam çakışacak</text><text x=\"455\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">biçimde birleştirilip</text><text x=\"455\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">paketlenecek.</text></svg></div><p>Ambalaj kâğıdı üst üste binmeyecek ve kâğıttan artık kalmayacaktır.</p><p><b>Buna göre bu paketleme için en az kaç santimetrekare ambalaj kâğıdı gerekir?</b></p>",
