   "a": "C",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>4 özdeş küp, ayrıtı 5 cm</li> <li>Yüzler tam çakışarak dikdörtgenler prizması oluşturuluyor</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Gereken en az ambalaj kâğıdı (cm²)</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Olası diziliş 1: yan yana</b> Dört küp bir sırada: 20 × 5 × 5. <span class=\"sv-m\">2 · (20·5 + 20·5 + 5·5) = 2 · 225 = 450 cm²</span></li> <li><b>Olası diziliş 2: 2’ye 2</b> Kare biçiminde: 10 × 10 × 5. <span class=\"sv-m\">2 · (10·10 + 10·5 + 10·5) = 2 · 200 = 400 cm²</span></li> <li><b>En küçüğü seç</b> Küpler ne kadar “toplu” dizilirse birbirine gizlenen yüz o kadar artar. <span class=\"sv-m\">en az 400 cm²</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 325 165\" width=\"325\" role=\"img\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><polygon points=\"75,65 195,65 195,125 75,125\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><polygon points=\"75,65 135,20 255,20 195,65\" fill=\"#f0f9ff\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><polygon points=\"195,65 255,20 255,80 195,125\" fill=\"#bae6fd\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><line x1=\"135\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"75\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><line x1=\"135\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"255\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><line x1=\"135\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"135\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><polygon points=\"75,65 195,65 195,125 75,125\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"75,65 135,20 255,20 195,65\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"255\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"255\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"255\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"195\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"135\" y=\"145\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10 cm</text><text x=\"239\" y=\"116.5\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">10 cm</text><text x=\"67\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\">5 cm</text></svg><figcaption>2’ye 2 diziliş: 10 × 10 × 5 cm.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Hacmi aynı prizmalar arasında küpe en yakın olanın yüzey alanı en küçüktür.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Tek bir dizilişi hesaplayıp karşılaştırmamak.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
