   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Silindir kap: r = 6 cm, su 10 cm</li> <li>Ayrıtı 6 cm küp tamamen batıyor; π = 3</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Küp bırakıldıktan sonraki su yüksekliği (cm)</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Küpün hacmi</b> Tamamen batan küp kendi hacmi kadar suyu yükseltir. <span class=\"sv-m\">6 · 6 · 6 = 216 cm³</span></li> <li><b>Kabın taban alanı</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">3 · 6² = 108 cm²</span></li> <li><b>Yükselme</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">216 ÷ 108 = 2 cm</span></li> <li><b>Yeni yükseklik</b> Kontrol: 12 cm &gt; 6 cm, küp gerçekten suyun içinde. <span class=\"sv-m\">10 + 2 = 12 cm</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 380 233\" width=\"380\" role=\"img\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><path d=\"M60 36.8 L60 186.8 A60 16.8 0 0 0 180 186.8 L180 36.8 Z\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"none\"/><path d=\"M60 102.8 L60 186.8 A60 16.8 0 0 0 180 186.8 L180 102.8 A60 16.8 0 0 1 60 102.8 Z\" fill=\"#7dd3fc\" stroke=\"none\"/><ellipse cx=\"120\" cy=\"102.8\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"16.8\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><ellipse cx=\"120\" cy=\"36.8\" rx=\"60\" ry=\"16.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"36.8\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"186.8\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"36.8\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"186.8\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M60 186.8 A60 16.8 0 0 0 180 186.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M60 186.8 A60 16.8 0 0 1 180 186.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"186.8\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"186.8\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"186.8\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"221.6\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\">r = 6</text><rect x=\"75\" y=\"144.8\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"171\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text><text x=\"188\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#075985\" text-anchor=\"start\">su: 10 + 2 = 12 cm</text></svg><figcaption>Küp 216 cm³ su yer değiştirir; su 2 cm yükselir.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Suyun küpün ayrıtı kadar (6 cm) yükseldiğini sanmak (→ 16).</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
