   "a": "D",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Gövde: silindir, r = 4 cm, h = 20 cm</li> <li>Külah: dik koni, r = 4 cm; yan yüzü merkez açısı 120° olan daire dilimi</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Roketin toplam yüksekliği (cm)</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Ana doğru</b> Dilimin yay uzunluğu koninin taban çevresine eşittir; dilimin yarıçapı ana doğrudur. <span class=\"sv-m\">2π · ℓ · {{120|360}} = 2π · 4 → {{ℓ|3}} = 4 → ℓ = 12 cm</span></li> <li><b>Külahın yüksekliği</b> h, r ve ℓ dik üçgen oluşturur. <span class=\"sv-m\">h² + 4² = 12² → h² = 128</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">h = √(64 · 2) = 8√2 cm</span></li> <li><b>Toplam</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">20 + 8√2 cm</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 258 194\" width=\"258\" role=\"img\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><path d=\"M104 24 L60 148.432 A44 12.32 0 0 0 148 148.432 Z\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"none\"/><line x1=\"104\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"148.432\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"104\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"148.432\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M60 148.432 A44 12.32 0 0 0 148 148.432\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M60 148.432 A44 12.32 0 0 1 148 148.432\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><line x1=\"104\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"104\" y2=\"148.432\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><polygon points=\"104,138.432 114,138.432 114,148.432\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"69.6\" y=\"103.659\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"end\">h = 8√2</text><line x1=\"104\" y1=\"148.432\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"148.432\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"178.752\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\">r = 4</text><line x1=\"104\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"148.432\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"86.216\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"start\">ℓ = 12</text></svg><figcaption>Külah: r = 4, ℓ = 12, yükseklik 8√2.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Merkez açısı 120° ise r = ℓ ÷ 3 olur.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Ana doğruyu yükseklik sanmak (→ 32) ya da Pisagor’da kareleri toplamak (→ 20 + 4√10).</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>D</b></div></div>"
